  "verified_workflow": [
    "Select a judge and enable Automatic through terminal controls; run a native turn and wait for automatic evaluation with complete resource evidence.",
    "Switch Manual, open the canonical checkpoint, correct Delivery with the retained original citations, change the explanation and submit the new revision through the terminal. Exactly one initial automatic and one manual revision are retained.",
    "Switch Automatic, draft/review/register a candidate through the terminal. Use New session repeatedly with unchanged launch settings and unmodified default bandit configuration.",
    "Wait until every trial session has numeric quality, complete cost and latency in the learner, and at least one trial actually dispatched the cheap candidate through the gateway.",
    "Inspect the Exploring block in the terminal, review and submit an operator withdrawal with a reason, and verify the durable publication. This is not automatic promotion or quality-triggered rollback.",
    "While Automatic remains enabled, send the next prompt in the native session that just used the candidate. Its new settled requests use the strong baseline. Finally switch Off and verify terminal restoration."
  ],
